###Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/user/
Content-Type: application/json

###Add User
POST http://localhost:8080/user/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Ronald",
  "password": "123",
  "email": "r@gmail.com"
}

### Update User
PATCH http://localhost:8080/user/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id":"1dceca2b-5228-453b-9028-84214dba63e9",
  "username": "New Ronald",
  "email": "r2@gmail.com"
}

### Delete User
@id = ce610723-f4a8-4aa3-baa0-e8353ab2dec9
DELETE http://localhost:8080/user/delete/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###======================================================

### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

### GET Tasks by ID
@USERID = 1dceca2b-5228-453b-9028-84214dba63e9
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{USERID}}

### ADD TASK
@userId = 1dceca2b-5228-453b-9028-84214dba63e9
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{userId}}/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Create Program in java",
  "description": "Read Java then create java application",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### DELETE TASK
@deleteId = 588f2738-8ab9-4583-97c7-18c133454325
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/remove/{{deleteId}}
Content-Type: application/json